Layer 7 Security is a security console for OPNsense. It identifies the
applications and websites behind your traffic with nDPI and shows them live
(Live Sessions) with one-click Block and Allow. Protection modules: Web
Control (wildcard website and IP rules), Application Control, content filtering
(CFS), DPI-SSL, and antivirus for downloads (malware hashes and YARA
signatures). Devices can be required to sign in. AI services can be controlled,
inspected and audited. Lists and signatures come from a feed server that your vendor
provides. A license key is required (a 30 day trial is available).

